ORIGINAL ARTWORK

The files in Data/ are upscaled versions of textures from the MU Online game
client by Webzen Inc., as distributed with the MuMain project
(https://github.com/sven-n/MuMain). Webzen retains all rights to the original
artwork. This repository grants no rights to it; the files may be used only
under the same conditions as the original assets.

UPSCALING MODELS

The textures were produced with these models:

- 4x-UltraSharp by Kim2091
  https://openmodeldb.info/models/4x-UltraSharp
  License: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0

- 4x_foolhardy_Remacri by FoolhardyVEVO
  https://openmodeldb.info/models/4x-Remacri
  License: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0

CC BY-NC-SA 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Changes made: every texture was upscaled ×4 (or ×2 where ×4 would exceed
1024 px), re-encoded in its original OZJ/OZT format, and marked with a scale
marker in the first four bytes of the header.

